Paseo is the agentic development environment: one interface to run Claude
Code, Codex, Copilot, OpenCode, and other coding agents, each in its own git
worktree if needed, and to orchestrate them from the desktop, a browser, or
a phone.

This port installs the Paseo daemon, which runs the agents, and the "paseo"
command-line client.  The daemon can also serve a browser web UI, and the
Paseo desktop and mobile apps connect to it over the network or through an
end-to-end encrypted relay.
